/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 61 0 R
/T ( Mental health discourse has historically struggled to distin--guish normative emotional dysregulation from clinically significant psychiatric pathology. This conceptual ambiguity has, at times, contributed to the over pathologisation of adaptive responses to trauma, chronic stress exposure, and unmet developmental needs \(Herman, 1992; van der Kolk, 2014\). Contemporary trauma and developmental research increasingly emphasises that many behavioural & affective disturbances reflect nervous system adaptations to envi-       -ronmental threat rather than primary disease processes \(Porges, 2011; Schore, 2003\). While the doctoral research of Duchess Dr. Letitia Kapuscinska provides an empirical framework for trauma-informed, voluntary, and integrative mental health care, the present contribution offers an experiential and pedagogical translation model designed to support emotional insight, self regulation, and participatory recovery. The Potted Plant Method is introduced as a trauma informed, neuro emotional mapping framework that)
/E ( Mental health discourse has historically struggled to distin--guish normative emotional dysregulation from clinically significant psychiatric pathology. This conceptual ambiguity has, at times, contributed to the over pathologisation of adaptive responses to trauma, chronic stress exposure, and unmet developmental needs \(Herman, 1992; van der Kolk, 2014\). Contemporary trauma and developmental research increasingly emphasises that many behavioural & affective disturbances reflect nervous system adaptations to envi-       -ronmental threat rather than primary disease processes \(Porges, 2011; Schore, 2003\). While the doctoral research of Duchess Dr. Letitia Kapuscinska provides an empirical framework for trauma-informed, voluntary, and integrative mental health care, the present contribution offers an experiential and pedagogical translation model designed to support emotional insight, self regulation, and participatory recovery. The Potted Plant Method is introduced as a trauma informed, neuro emotional mapping framework that)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [30]
>>
